ctional flight with full keyboard controls.\nTeleport to Murderer: Instantly teleport to the current murderer.\nTeleport to Sheriff: Instantly teleport to the current sheriff.\nESP: Murderer: Highlights the murderer's location through walls.\nESP: Sheriff: Highlights the sheriff's location through walls.\nESP: Gun Drop: Shows the location of the dropped gun at all times.\nESP: Knife Drop: Displays the location of dropped knives through walls.\nAuto-Collect Coins (Loop): Continuously collects coins as they spawn.\nESP: Innocents: Highlights all innocent players through walls.\nAnti-Fling / Anti-Void: Protects against fling exploits and falling into the void.\nServer Hop: Instantly join a different public server.\n\nMm2","tags":["murder mystery","Auto Grab Gun","Kill Aura","ESP","mm"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://flowauth.net/v1/ui/a87f00d9adf63658655fcd02ab86a4ef.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"696ff36b3593559f36ddb741","username":"snowy","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/1fd7e4f7db7454970708a731adacc16dd1984da51d25268d0bfee1e88b6e4d74.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/696ff36b3593559f36ddb741-1789861822395.png"},"lvl":23,"status":"offline","id":"696ff36b3593559f36ddb741","leaderboard":{"tag":{"kind":"hall","rank":2,"period":"all","metric":"likes","value":1954}},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":1000},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/1fd7e4f7db7454970708a731adacc16dd1984da51d25268d0bfee1e88b6e4d74.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/696ff36b3593559f36ddb741-1789861822395.png"}},"verified":true,"discord":"https://discord.gg/getsnowy","keyLink":"https://discord.gg/getsnowy","views":39000,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/8b1fceb066ee705fdbb8da0d92bdceee335e52ec9a4fdd35050b46bcd67358ac.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-fe7335c3ad752e84323cd81ae38de6